<title>JAPAN: Japan Nov domestic WPI down 0.6 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan Nov domestic WPI down 0.6 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's domestic wholesale price index, a key component of the overall WPI, was down 0.6 percent in November from a year earlier, but up 0.1 percent from October, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of the November WPI:</p>
<p>Year-on-year (in percent)</p>
<p>	    November   October</p>
<p> Overall   +0.5	  +0.3</p>
<p> Domestic  -0.6	  -0.7</p>
<p> Exports   +2.4	  +3.1</p>
<p> Imports  +11.4	  +9.9</p>
<p>Month-on-month (in percent, index base year 1990):</p>
<p>	    November  October    Index</p>
<p> Overall  +0.3	   +0.1    93.1</p>
<p> Domestic +0.1	   -0.2    95.1</p>
<p> Exports  -0.2	   +1.2    86.0</p>
<p> Imports  +2.3	   +2.8    83.8</p>
</text>
